pdpmake, the public domain POSIX make of Ron Yorston, taken from
https://github.com/rmyorston/pdpmake at commit
02f03e299ac141817675e2b0d876741ceef136a4
on 2026-09-06 with tools/fetch_make.sh.

Copied without modification:
  src/      check.c, input.c, macro.c, main.c, make.c, make.h, modtime.c,
            rules.c, target.c, utils.c and the manual page pdpmake.1
  LICENSE   the public domain dedication
  README.md, Makefile  the upstream readme and build file (not used)

user/Makefile compiles src/ into build/user/make/ and links /bin/make with
the default configuration of make.h: the non-POSIX extensions and the
POSIX 2024 features are enabled. The vendored files are exempt from the
minios line count and naming conventions. See docs/design/make.md.
